&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:9.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;無機化成品&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:9.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;二硫化炭素、無水芒硝&lt;br/&gt;不溶性硫黄&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:9.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;(子)&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;四国化成工業㈱&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;　　シコク硫炭㈱&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="3" style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:9.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;(子)&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;四国化成工業㈱&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:20.6pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-16pt;line-height:9.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;　　SHIKOKU INTERNATIONAL&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:20.6pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-16pt;line-height:9.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;　　CORPORATION&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:20.6pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-16pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:9.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;　　シコク環境ビジネス㈱&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:20.6pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-16pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:9.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;　　シコク分析センター㈱&lt;/p&gt;
